# Cloudinary — direct image uploads (listing photos, profile photo, builder
# logo, ad image). Both values are public. Create an UNSIGNED upload preset in
# Cloudinary → Settings → Upload → Upload presets, and restrict it: allowed
# formats jpg,png,webp; max file size 10 MB; folder vxp. The API secret is
# never needed here — when the backend gets Cloudinary credentials, listing
# photos switch to its signed tickets automatically.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
